# Frontend layer ownership

- **Write**: `client/src/app/**`, `client/src/modules/**`, `client/src/components/**`, `client/src/theme/**`, `client/src/store/**`.
- **Do not**: change server code or Mongoose schemas; call Google Sheets or QuickBooks from the browser; store OAuth secrets or tokens in client state; bypass Redux for app-wide state.

Use `shared` types and server API contracts as read-only references. Align with `.agents/frontend/AGENTS.md`.
